## 3. 数据结构

### 用户信息 (User)
```javascript
{
  userId: string,
  nickname: string,
  avatar: string,
  phone: string,           // 加密存储
  email: string,           // 加密存储
  passwordHash: string,    // 加密存储
  createdAt: timestamp,
  lastLoginAt: timestamp,

  // 游戏数据
  stats: {
    totalGames: number,
    wins: number,
    currentLevel: string,
    highestLevel: string
  }
}
```

